      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried calling them but the people on the phone are just reading scripts... it's like they're trained to avoid answering anything direct. it feels like they're waiting for me to mess up so they can claim i'm \"unstable\" or something and just seize the account. \n\ni dont want to just \"report it\" to the government because they probably have the same people working for them. i need to know how to hide my assets from them or move them around so they cant track the liquidation process. how can i move my money into accounts or systems they cant easily freeze or touch?",
